<p><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VHGb!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff859b498-d24c-48fd-bf0f-ee0ab7cce660_320x240.jpeg" alt=""></p>
