<p><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VpvN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd8fc7ef5-beeb-417c-87c4-0b8e6e8c7a12_400x335.png" alt=""></p>
