<p><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!c7MS!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F54ae4f3a-5287-4a44-932a-34505e37561e_320x212.jpeg" alt=""></p>
