</li>
<li><p>i cijepljeni umiru, ali cjepivo svejedno štiti od težih oblika bolesti -&gt; stvarnost kaže NE (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2022/08/16/health/biden-administration-covid-19-vaccines-tests-treatments/index.html">https://edition.cnn.com/2022/08/16/health/biden-administration-covid-19-vaccines-tests-treatments/index.html</a>)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p>***</p>
<p>Pitanja, dakle, ostaju ista kao i na početku; zašto ste nas agresivno tjerali na neefektivno cjepivo, zašto ste nas segregirali po cijepnom statusu, zašto ste nas zatvarali i oduzimali nam temeljna individualna prava, zašto ste nas cenzurirali, zašto ste nas vrijeđali, zašto ste ucjenama prisiljavali da cijepimo djecu kao daleko najmanje rizičnu covid skupinu, zašto ste dehumanizirali nas i našu djecu, zašto ste nam davali otkaze, zašto ste bacili stotine milijuna ljudi diljem svijeta u apsolutno siromaštvo i glad, a milijunima djece onemogućili školovanje (<a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2022/1/10/ugandan-children-back-to-school-after-nearly-2-year-covid-closure">https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2022/1/10/ugandan-children-back-to-school-after-nearly-2-year-covid-closure</a>, <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2021/feb/03/decades-of-progress-on-extreme-poverty-now-in-reverse-due-to-covid">https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2021/feb/03/decades-of-progress-on-extreme-poverty-now-in-reverse-due-to-covid</a>), itd.? </p>
