<p><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6-nj!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1d78b352-2cb9-4494-945c-a40de8b1a461_1600x1200.jpeg" alt=""></p>
